      "yaml_text": "version: '1.1'\ncomment: |\n  PURPOSE: orders metrics over m7f_orders\n\n  BEST FOR: total amount overall | total amount by branch name | total amount by area name\n\n  NOT FOR: Row-level inspection or record lookup (query serverless_stable_6t92c3_catalog.prashanth_wanderbricks_gold.m7f_orders directly instead)\n\n  DIMENSIONS: branch_name, area_name\n\n  MEASURES: total_amount, order_count\n\n  SOURCE: m7f_orders (m7f proof domain)\n\n  JOINS: pre-joined in the source subquery, deduplicated on the join key (dim_branch, dim_area)\n\n  NOTE: Dimension attributes are pre-joined and deduplicated on the join key, so a duplicated dimension row contributes one value rather than fanning out the fact\nsource: |\n  SELECT fact.*, dim_branch.`branch_name` AS `branch_name`, dim_area.`area_name` AS `area_name`\n  FROM `serverless_stable_6t92c3_catalog`.`prashanth_wanderbricks_gold`.`m7f_orders` AS fact\n  LEFT JOIN (SELECT `branch_id`, MAX(`area_id`) AS `area_id`, MAX(`branch_name`) AS `branch_name` FROM `serverless_stable_6t92c3_catalog`.`prashanth_wanderbricks_gold`.`m7f_branch` WHERE `is_current` = true GROUP BY `branch_id`) AS dim_branch ON fact.`branch_id` = dim_branch.`branch_id`\n  LEFT JOIN (SELECT `area_id`, MAX(`area_name`) AS `area_name` FROM `serverless_stable_6t92c3_catalog`.`prashanth_wanderbricks_gold`.`m7f_area` GROUP BY `area_id`) AS dim_area ON dim_branch.`area_id` = dim_area.`area_id`\ndimensions:\n  - name: branch_name\n    expr: source.`branch_name`\n    comment: Branch Name for slicing orders.\n    display_name: Branch Name\n    synonyms:\n      - branch name\n      - name\n      - orders branch name\n      - orders\n  - name: area_name\n    expr: source.`area_name`\n    comment: Area Name for slicing orders.\n    display_name: Area Name\n    synonyms:\n      - area name\n      - name\n      - orders area name\n      - orders\nmeasures:\n  - name: total_amount\n    expr: SUM(source.`amount`)\n    comment: Total order amount.\n    display_name: Total Amount\n    format:\n      type: currency\n      currency_code: USD\n      decimal_places:\n        type: exact\n        places: 2\n      abbreviation: compact\n    synonyms:\n      - total amount\n      - amount\n      - orders total amount\n      - orders\n  - name: order_count\n    expr: COUNT(source.`order_id`)\n    comment: Number of orders.\n    display_name: Order Count\n    format:\n      type: number\n      decimal_places:\n        type: all\n      abbreviation: compact\n    synonyms:\n      - order count\n      - count\n      - orders order count\n      - orders\n",
